flowchart LR
 P21[Phase 21 Consolidated Baseline] --> Recon[Final Reconciliation]
 Recon --> Findings[Finding Disposition]
 Findings --> Canon[Canonical Architecture/Data/API Baseline]
 Canon --> Backlog[Implementation Backlog]
 Backlog --> Build[Human + AI Development]
 Build --> Test[Automated + UAT + Security + Performance + DR]
 Test --> PRR[Production Readiness]
 PRR --> Gates[Final Approval Gates]
 Gates --> Manifest[Signed/Approved Manifest]
 Manifest --> Lock[GES v1.0 LOCKED]
 Lock --> Change[Controlled Post-Lock Change Management]
